spoint MAX-PERF vegetation+rocks run (gm-skill, 2026-06-18, branch dna-quality-fixes). Goal: 30k+ trees+rocks @144fps on slow devices. Workflow .claude/workflows/veg-perf.js (wf_3dd177af-daf, 12 agents, winner hybrid-tiered 0.78); full spec .gm/witness/veg-perf-plan.md (204 lines). Also a /veg-perf skill.

KEY WITNESSED FINDING: the renderer is FRAGMENT-bound, not CPU-bound (veg update() 0.5ms). Baseline 23.2fps/817k tris/42 draws/2514 trees on AMD Radeon iGPU (ANGLE D3D11, real GPU not software - headless chromium IS gpu-accelerated). The OCTAHEDRAL IMPOSTOR SHADER PATH is the per-pixel bottleneck: pulling the impostor cutover D3 CLOSE (more/bigger impostors) REGRESSED fps 23->5 even though tris dropped 817k->97k. So keep impostors FAR/small; tri count is secondary.

SHIPPED + committed (each browser-witnessed, measured vs baseline):
1. Fragment levers (commit 4b5f6f37): adaptive dynamic-resolution controller app.js _dpr (45-frame window, hysteresis around 6.94ms, scale MIN 0.40 MAX 1.0, window.__dpr/__dprOff) + PCFSoftShadowMap->PCFShadowMap + shadow map 2048->1024 + trunk-only veg shadow (dropped leaf alpha-test shadow) + BVH margin 4->0 + impostor RT dispose leak fix. RESULT veg-only 23.2->48.6fps (2x). DPR is the load-bearing lever (fragment-bound).
2. Rocks system (commit 139fc2b8): src/terrain/RockShapes.js+RockTriTableShared.js revived from git 616fd208~1 (pure SDF marching-cubes, makeRockSDF/marchRockSurface/generateRockHullData, 6 types seed 1337+t*7919); src/terrain/RockPlacement.js (imports hash3/rand/trunkIdOf VERBATIM from VegPlacement, salt keys 10-17, slope-INVERTED density: dense on high-erosion+steep+arid, FLOOR scatter lowland, no slope-max reject); client/core/Rocks.js (InstancedMesh2 per type, meshopt LODs, BVH cull, super->per-chunk streaming, cap 12k); src/terrain/RockPhysics.js (convex-hull colliders pre-scaled per bucket + shapeKey cache, physScale cap 3.5, gated terrain.vegetation.rockColliders DEFAULT OFF until parity round-trip witnessed). Tests RockPlacement(8)+RockShapes(4), npm test 161/161.
3. Shade (commit ab29c750): per-instance tint fragment uniform (initUniformsPerInstance {fragment:{tint}}, inject 'diffuseColor.rgb *= tint' at #include <color_fragment>, customProgramCacheKey bumped) on BOTH trees+rocks, deterministic brightness jitter from placement hash. Rock base res 26->16 (was an fps regression).
4. Streaming stall fix (commit 02afa6e4): per-32m-chunk streaming up to 3 chunks/frame (was 4-chunk super-cell burst) -> max frame gap 638ms->49ms (stutter gone). DPR floor 0.55->0.40.

FINAL combined steady (AMD iGPU): ~28fps, 893k tris, 50 draws, DPR floor 0.40, max frame gap 49ms, 0 errors, 2662 trees + 298 rocks. 144fps NOT reached on THIS iGPU - needs the deep architecture still PENDING.

